{"id":"bf97099d9a48be46","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-raynaud.md","title":"Raynaud's Manin–Mumford Theorem","display":"thm-raynaud — Raynaud's Manin–Mumford Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-raynaud","aliases":["58-thm-raynaud"],"display":"thm-raynaud — Raynaud's Manin–Mumford Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-raynaud"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-raynaud</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-raynaud — Raynaud's Manin–Mumford Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" href=\"?note=bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md\">../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6046552157f71d9c\" href=\"?note=6046552157f71d9c\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md\">../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" href=\"?note=d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,m,\\iota,e,P,d,\\tau_P,\\tau_A,C,B_j,a_j\\in V\">\\(A,X,m,\\iota,e,P,d,\\tau_P,\\tau_A,C,B_j,a_j\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" href=\"?note=bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md\">../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\\)</span> supplies an explicit projective ambient space and Zariski topology</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_P\\}\">\\(\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_P\\}\\)</span> is the induced Zariski topology and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Closed}_S\\)</span> is its closed-set predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> is the typed closure graph from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" href=\"?note=d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\cdot_m a\">\\(n\\cdot_m a\\)</span> is the recursively defined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-fold group sum: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\cdot_m a=e\">\\(0\\cdot_m a=e\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+1)\\cdot_m a=m(\\langle n\\cdot_m a,a\\rangle)\">\\((n+1)\\cdot_m a=m(\\langle n\\cdot_m a,a\\rangle)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{tors}}=\\{a\\in A:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(n\\cdot_m a=e)\\}\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{tors}}=\\{a\\in A:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(n\\cdot_m a=e)\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a+_mB=\\{m(\\langle a,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\">\\(a+_mB=\\{m(\\langle a,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}raynaud}\\vdash&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(\\mathbb C,A,m,\\iota,e)\n\\land\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\n\\land\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_P\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(X,A,\\tau_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists C\\in V\\;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists(B_i)_{i&lt;n}\\;\n\\exists(a_i)_{i&lt;n}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,X\\cap A_{\\mathrm{tors}},A,\\tau_A)\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;\n\\bigl(\nB_i\\subseteq A\n\\land\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(B_i;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(B_i,A,\\tau_A)\n\\land e\\in B_i\n\\land m[B_i\\times B_i]\\subseteq B_i\n\\land \\iota[B_i]\\subseteq B_i\n\\land a_i\\in A_{\\mathrm{tors}}\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nC\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}(a_i+_mB_i)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}raynaud}\\vdash&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(\\mathbb C,A,m,\\iota,e)\n\\land\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\n\\land\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_P\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(X,A,\\tau_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists C\\in V\\;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists(B_i)_{i&lt;n}\\;\n\\exists(a_i)_{i&lt;n}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,X\\cap A_{\\mathrm{tors}},A,\\tau_A)\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;\n\\bigl(\nB_i\\subseteq A\n\\land\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(B_i;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(B_i,A,\\tau_A)\n\\land e\\in B_i\n\\land m[B_i\\times B_i]\\subseteq B_i\n\\land \\iota[B_i]\\subseteq B_i\n\\land a_i\\in A_{\\mathrm{tors}}\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nC\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}(a_i+_mB_i)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, torsion points are Zariski dense in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is a finite union of torsion translates of abelian subvarieties.</li>\n<li>The former hyperbolicity-to-finiteness statement was a Lang-type conjectural claim, not Raynaud's theorem.</li>\n<li>The abelian variety now carries the multiplication, inverse, and identity parameters required by the upstream five-argument predicate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\">\\(B_i\\)</span> is explicitly an abelian subvariety rather than an untyped order comparison.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md","status":"resolved","id":"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md","status":"resolved","id":"6046552157f71d9c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"d5b6b8b83b0796ef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md","status":"resolved","id":"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"d5b6b8b83b0796ef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4$ is the typed closure graph from [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,X,m,\\iota,e,P,d,\\tau_P,\\tau_A,C,B_j,a_j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_P\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"n\\cdot_m a","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"0\\cdot_m a=e","display":false},{"tex":"(n+1)\\cdot_m a=m(\\langle n\\cdot_m a,a\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{tors}}=\\{a\\in A:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(n\\cdot_m a=e)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a+_mB=\\{m(\\langle a,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}raynaud}\\vdash&\n\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(\\mathbb C,A,m,\\iota,e)\n\\land\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\n\\land\\tau_A=\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_P\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(X,A,\\tau_A)\\\\\n&\\to\n\\exists C\\in V\\;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists(B_i)_{i<n}\\;\n\\exists(a_i)_{i<n}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,X\\cap A_{\\mathrm{tors}},A,\\tau_A)\n\\land\n\\forall i<n\\;\n\\bigl(\nB_i\\subseteq A\n\\land\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(B_i;P,\\mathbb C,d,\\tau_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Closed}_S(B_i,A,\\tau_A)\n\\land e\\in B_i\n\\land m[B_i\\times B_i]\\subseteq B_i\n\\land \\iota[B_i]\\subseteq B_i\n\\land a_i\\in A_{\\mathrm{tors}}\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\nC\n=\n\\bigcup_{i<n}(a_i+_mB_i)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B_i","display":false}],"bytes":2462,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4386","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-raynaud.md|58-thm-raynaud]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","6046552157f71d9c","3600401d4adbcbd4","d5b6b8b83b0796ef"]}